{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/ansikhah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אַנְסִיכָה מַלְכִּי. לְפָנָיו בְּהִתְהַלְּכִי. אָמְצוֹ בְּהַמְלִיכִי. יֶאֱזוֹר עֹז וְיִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/elil"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"אֱלִיל בְּהַשְׁלִיכִי. לִפְנֵי בוֹא יוֹם מַלְכִּי. אִישׁ מַלְאָכִי יִשְׁלַח, וְאָז יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/bevoo"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בְּבוֹאוֹ לַהֲלוֹךְ. נְתוֹשׁ חָנֵף מִמְּלוֹךְ. בֵּית גֵּאִים בְּלִי מְלוֹךְ. יִסַּח לְבַל יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/betokhi"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"בְּתוֹכִי יַהֲלוֹךְ. בְּהוֹפִיעוֹ לִמְלוֹךְ. בְּמַלְכוּתוֹ אֶמְלוֹךְ. וְאָז יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/geveret"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"גְּבֶרֶת מַמְלָכוֹת. בְּמַגְּרוֹ מַמְלָכוֹת. גּוֹיִם וּמַמְלָכוֹת. יָהוֹם וְהוּא יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/gilyon"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"גִּלְיוֹן הֲלִיכוֹת. וְסֵפֶר תַּהֲלוּכוֹת. גַּל הַיּוֹם לְזַכּוֹת. חוֹכָיו לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n261.jpg","n":"121"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/dorekhet"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"דּוֹרֶכֶת נְסִיכוּת. בְּחִנּוּן קוֹל בָּכוּת. דִּבְּרָה אֲנִי בְּמַלְכוּת. וּמִי יוּכַל לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/dakkei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"דַּכְּאֵי רוּחַ נְמִיכוּת. מְחַפְּשֵׂי בְּיוֹם דִּין זְכוּת. דָּשָׁה בְּעֹל מַלְכוּת. עַד צוּר יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/hillukh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הִלּוּךְ מַהֲלָךְ. חֲמֵשׁ מֵאוֹת הִלַּךְ. הָדוּר עַד הָמְלַךְ. בְּעֻזּוֹ לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/havel"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"הַבֵּל הַמָּמְלָךְ. עַל מֶה מָלַךְ. הֲלֹא בְּמִי נִמְלָךְ. כִּי אָץ לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/umillifnei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וּמִלִּפְנֵי מְלֹךְ מֶלֶךְ. חַי מִלְּפָנִים מֶלֶךְ. וְעַד תִּכֶל כָּל מֶלֶךְ. הוּא לְבַדּוֹ יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/umah"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"וּמַה יָעֹז מֹלֶךְ. בְּעֹז מִשְׁפַּט מֶלֶךְ. וְכַעֲבוֹר סוּפָה בְּהֵלֶךְ. יַחֲלוֹף מִמְּלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/zakh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זָךְ דִּין בְּעָרְכוֹ. יֹאחֵז דַּרְכּוֹ. זֵדִים בְּדָרְכוֹ. נָקָם יַעַט וְיִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n263.jpg","n":"122"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/zer"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"זֵר בְּשַׁלְּכוֹ. יִתֵּן עֹז לְמַלְכּוֹ. זַכִּים בְּהַמְלִיכוֹ. עַל כֹּל יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/chiddeshu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"חִדְּשׁוּ מְלוּכָה. כַּדָּת וְכַהֲלָכָה. חֹטֶר מַמְלָכָה. בְּמִישׁוֹר יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/chovesh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"חֹבֶשׁ אֲרוּכָה. וְאֹרֶךְ יוֹם מְבוּכָה. חֲתֻלָּה לְמַכָּה. יַעַל בְּעֵת יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/torach"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"טֹרַח מַלְכִיּוֹת. עוֹבְדֵי מַשְׂכִּיּוֹת. טִמְּאוּ חֶמֶד שְׂכִיּוֹת. בְּגַאֲוָה לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/tohar"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"טֹהַר זָכִיּוֹת. וְשַׁאַג קוֹל בְּכִיוֹת. טֶבַע צוּל דָּכְיוֹת. יִפֶן וּבָם יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/yahav"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יָהַב מַשְׁלִיכִים. עָלָיו בְּנֵי מְלָכִים. יוֹם זֶה לוֹ מְחַכִּים. בּוֹ יָבֹא לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/yaavru"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"יַעַבְרוּ מִתְהַלְּכִים. לְפָנָיו כְּמַלְאָכִים. יַחַד מַמְלִיכִים. "}
{"start":"j:divineName","attrs":{}}
{"text":"יְיָ"}
{"end":"j:divineName"}
{"tail":" יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/kittim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כִּתִּים בְּכַתְּתוֹ. אִיִּים בְּהַכֹּתוֹ. כֵּס מַמְלַכְתּוֹ. "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n265.jpg","n":"123"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"יִכּוֹן וְיִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/kevod"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"כְּבוֹד מַלְכוּתוֹ. וְקָדוֹשׁ הֲלִיכָתוֹ. בְּגָמְרוֹ מְלַאכְתּוֹ. לְעֵין כֹּל יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/lekhol"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לְכָל גֹּבַהּ יַפִּיל. וְהַר וָגֶבַע יַשְׁפִּיל. לְכָל אוֹם יַאְפִּיל. וּכְאוֹר זָרוּעַ יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/leroi"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"לְרָאִי יַקְפִּיל. וַחֲדָשִׁים יַכְפִּיל. לְיוֹם זֶה פּוּר הִפִּיל. מִצִּיּוֹן לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/matu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מָטוּ גוֹיִם. הָמוּ גֵּאִים. מָעֲדוּ מִתְגָּאִים. גֵּאֶה בְּבֹאוֹ לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/malkhu"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"מָלְכוּ דְגוּיִם. נִטָּלוּ סְגוּיִם. מֶלֶךְ הַגּוֹיִם. עֵת אָתָא לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/nedivei"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"נְדִיבֵי עַמִּים. יֵאָסְפוּ מֵעַמִּים. נְשׂוֹא מְעֻטֵּי עַמִּים. אֶל מְקוֹמָם יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/niggun"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"נִגּוּן נְעִימִים. לְמוּלָם מַנְעִימִים. נְשָׂאָם מֵעֲמָמִים. עֲלֵיהֶם לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/sikkut"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"סִכּוּת אֱלִילִים. כִּיּוּן "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n267.jpg","n":"124"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"גִּלּוּלִים. סָחוֹב כְּמוֹ חֲלָלִים. יָשְׁלָכוּ בְּלִי לִמְלוֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/sod"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"סוֹד אֵל אֵלִים. הָבוּ בְּנֵי אֵלִים. שְׂאוּ זִמְרָה וְהִלּוּלִים. לָאָדוֹן כִּי יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/izzuz"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עִזּוּז יָד בְּהַשִּׂיאוֹ. לְהָרִים נְשִׂיאוֹ. עֲמֻסָיו בְּנַשְּׂאוֹ. יָעֹז וְיִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/al_rum"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"עַל רוֹם מַשָּׂאוֹ. יָדֵיהוּ בְּנָשְׂאוֹ. עַל הוֹד כִּסְאוֹ. יֵשֵׁב וְיִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/pur"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"פּוּר תְּפוֹרֵר אֶרֶץ. בְּכִלָּיוֹן וָחֶרֶץ. פַּח בְּיוֹשְׁבֵי הָאָרֶץ. יַרְגִּיז וְיִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/pachad"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"פַּחַד שׁוֹפְרוֹת עֶרֶץ. יְשַׁלֵּשׁ וּבָם יִרֶץ. פְּאֵר מִכְּנַף הָאָרֶץ. יַעֲלוּ כִּי יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/tzevi"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"צְבִי מֵהֲדֹם יַעַל. וְאֶדֶר מִשַּׁעַל. צַהַל מִשְּׁמֵי מַעַל. יְרַנְּנוּ כִּי יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/tzevaot"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"צִבְאוֹת כָּל פֹּעַל. לְצַלְעָם יַרְמֵי תַּעַל. צְפִירַת פְּאֵר לְהַעַל. הֵן לְצֶדֶק יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/qetzinim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"קְצִינִים אֲשֶׁר מָלְכוּ. אַדֶּרֶת יַשְׁלִיכוּ. "}
{"start":"t:pb","attrs":{"ed":"1965","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n269.jpg","n":"125"}}
{"end":"t:pb"}
{"tail":"קוֹל יְתַנּוּ וְיַמְלִיכוּ. לָאָדוֹן כִּי יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/qeruim"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"קְרוּאִים יִמְלוֹכוּ. וְאַחֲרָיו יַהֲלוֹכוּ. קוֹמֲמִיּוּת יֵלֵכוּ. וּבְרֹאשָׁם יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/raz"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"רָז הַמְּכֻמָּן. לְיוֹם זֶה מְזֻמָּן. רָשׁוּם לְמוֹעֵד וּזְמַן. וּבוֹ נוֹקֵם יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/roeh"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"רוֹעֶה נֶאֱמָן. בְּבֹאוֹ מִתֵּימָן. רוּחַ יַסְעִיר כְּתֵימָן. בְּגִלְעָד יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/shinan"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שִׁנְאַן עֲלִיּוֹת. וְסוֹד "}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}id":"musaf_ansikhah_shinan_variant"}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{}}
{"text":"פְּלִיאִיּוֹת"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{}}
{"text":"פְּלִילִיּוֹת"}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"end":"t:choice"}
{"tail":". שִׁיר מִתְלוּלִיּוֹת. יִפְצְחוּ כִּי יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/sheiyyot"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"שְׁאִיּוֹת תַּחְתִּיּוֹת. וְהוֹד אוֹתִיּוֹת. שְׁאוֹן הֲמוֹן בְּרִיּוֹת. יָרִיעוּ כִּי יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:ansikhah_malki/tekhan"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"תְּכַן כֵּס כַּשֶּׁמֶשׁ. שְׁמוֹ לִפְנֵי שֶׁמֶשׁ. תָּאֳרוֹ כְּצֵאת הַשֶּׁמֶשׁ. בְּמָלְכוֹ יִמְלֹךְ: "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
